{
  "bookId": "rewind-39",
  "id": "chapter-155",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34701001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……快醒……快醒醒……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……是谁的声音？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701003",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……约定……不要忘记……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……想不起来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "岛主，您终于醒过来了！\n感觉好点了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好像还有点头晕……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "糟糕，这该怎么办……还记得我是谁吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "34701010",
              "text": "不记得了"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "34701010",
              "text": "你是仓田家的……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "34701009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "呜……我是岛主的得力助手，仓田真乃。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……哦？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "我已经找了岛主好久了……这才发现您躺在沙滩上。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "沙滩？我现在在哪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "这里是维纳斯群岛的其中一座岛屿，岛主是这座岛的主人哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……我是这座岛屿的主人？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "看起来是睡迷糊了呢，唔……已经没时间解释了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "请跟我来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "等等，跟过去是要做什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "您早上不是委托我去把这届挑战赛的「封面女孩」召集到小屋里了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "她们还在等岛主送去这次的特别泳装呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "34701022",
              "text": "信息量突然有点大！"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "34701022",
              "text": "很好，我逐渐理解一切……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "34701021",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "别担心，真乃会帮岛主和她们沟通的。\n岛主就放心跟我走吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "大家久等了，岛主到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34701025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "呃……你们好？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-807",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "doaxvv",
          "rowIds": [
