      ],
      "title": "海岛与塞壬·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34702001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "真是的，你迟到了呢。\n可别让玛莉等得太久了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702002",
          "sourceType": 7,
          "text": "玛莉萝丝 · 小恶魔仆人\n商品名称：玛莉萝丝·小恶魔仆人Ver.\n作品出处：《DEAD OR ALIVE Xtreme Venus Vacation》\n制造商：GALATEA 伽拉\n手办材质：ABS&PVC 涂装完成\n手办规格：1/7比例模型·附专用底座・全高约210mm",
          "title": "角色介绍卡",
          "type": "profile"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "啊，上午好，岛主~\n呵呵，刚才是遇到什么趣事了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702004",
          "sourceType": 7,
          "text": "穗香 · 绝密校园女孩\n商品名称：穗香·绝密校园女孩Ver.\n作品出处：《DEAD OR ALIVE Xtreme Venus Vacation》\n制造商：SNOW.A 细雪庭\n手办材质：ABS&PVC 涂装完成\n手办规格：1/7比例模型·附专用底座・全高约215mm",
          "title": "角色介绍卡",
          "type": "profile"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……真是不好意思。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "（悄悄话）岛主应该还记得她们吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "玛莉萝丝……和穗香？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "嗯，穗香在这里哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "……被选做「封面女孩」是很开心，但岛主却一直让玛莉等着……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "小玛莉是想说，很期待岛主要送来的泳装呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "呃……泳装……在哪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "岛主已经让真乃准备好了哦，锵锵~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702013",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "少女一边朝这边使眼色，一边拿出了泳装礼盒。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……没错，请收下这两套泳装。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "哎嘿嘿，我收下了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "那个……非常感谢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702017",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "过了一会儿，玛莉和穗香换上了新的泳装。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "哎，这是有点熟悉的天使泳装。\n岛主看看，我们这一身合适吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "欸……可爱的小恶魔泳装……\n玛莉给人的印象果然是小恶魔吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "34702021",
              "text": "你们穿着很合适"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "34702021",
              "text": "你们穿着很好看"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "34702020",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "那就好，我也很喜欢呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "唔，那就没问题了。\n作为封面女孩，「小恶魔玛莉」不会输给任何人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "「天使穗香」再度登场~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "（悄悄话）……到底什么是封面女孩？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "（悄悄话）封面女孩会在宣传活动中扮演重要角色，要负责把挑战赛的氛围变得更加热闹哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "岛主，这次挑战赛的主题是什么呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……主题？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "之前岛主和我说，挑战赛的主题是「假期」哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34702029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "欸，假期？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-808",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "doaxvv",
          "rowIds": [
            34702001,
            34702002,
            34702003,
            34702004,
