      "title": "海岛与塞壬·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34704001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我这边准备好了，开始录像。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "虽说在拍摄假期宣传片，我可不会留手。\n希望你们也是。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "获胜规则为先得6分,「天使和小恶魔」队先发球！\n我宣布，比赛开始！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "……为什么这家伙这么自然地做起裁判来了啊？\n算了，那就认真地来打一场吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "嗯！大家一起努力地上吧~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "让你们尝尝「小恶魔玛莉」的厉害。\n玛莉上咯~嘿！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "这样的发球，真是小菜一碟！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "排球攻防战持续了一段时间，阳子高高地跃起。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "有本事就给我接住吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "出现了！阳子选手拿手的全力扣杀！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "速度好快！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "呜，没接到……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "漂亮！「深潜海盗」队先得一分！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "喂，我们可没取这么奇怪的队伍名字！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704015",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "数个回合后，面对飞来的排球，彩音举起双手——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "这样的力度应该刚刚好吧~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "精准的吊球！排球擦过了球网后直接坠地！\n「深潜海盗」再得一分！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "是不能大意的对手呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34704019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "嗯，玛莉也要认真起来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "……现在比分来到了1：4。\n「天使与小恶魔」没有办法挽回颓势了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "唔，感觉玛莉她们一点也不紧张……\n还只是在热身吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "noticeKind": "branch-config",
          "sourceId": "34850003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "text": "本行配置含选项，原游戏是否显示未确认；以下保留配置原文。",
          "type": "notice"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "34850004",
              "text": "或许是吧"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "34850004",
              "text": "她们已经想到了取胜的办法"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "34850003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "就是现在，穗香——Attack!",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850005",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "……竟然不是扣杀！？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "排球以眼熟的方式擦过了球网，直坠而下！\n穗香选手得分！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "这是……模仿了我的球路？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "哎嘿嘿，只是模仿了一点发力的动作。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "好，就保持这个态势——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "……玛莉选手得分！比分3:4！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "……比分追平！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "……穗香选手得分！比分5:4！\n「天使与小恶魔」拿到了赛点！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "……阳子选手得分！比分5:5，再次追平！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "阳子选手的斜线发球！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "接到了……小玛莉！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850016",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "面对穗香托传来的排球，玛莉跃起的身姿沐浴着阳光——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "尝尝这招，嘿呀——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "流畅的配合，扣球得分！\n比赛结束，「天使与小恶魔」获胜！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850019",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "这时，在远处——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "她们看起来还有几分实力。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "哼哼哼，无论是谁，都不能阻止本王登上挑战赛的顶点！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34850022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "……就再观察一下好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-810",
